{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112259896364429312","3_2112259915347832832"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:09:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112259925984543076"],"id":"2112259925984543076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":157,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#121 Visited Nalin Sarkar Street. Good pandal and pratima. https://t.co/g3O6wWqjaR","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112259925984543076"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112210068544663552","3_2112210092317949953","3_2112210108591783940"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-19T15:51:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112210120495247544"],"id":"2112210120495247544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":255,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#107 Visited Behala Club. Very good themes. Their theme is \"তেল\". They have depicted the importance of Oil in human society. Very good themes pandal for people who are into these things. https://t.co/bERtmOs6Y7","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112210120495247544"},{"author_id":"2609353712","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:59:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111894883359485991"],"id":"2111894883359485991","in_reply_to_user_id":"1780314375548518400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":75,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111891376036274226","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@jktaelove276069 Samee! I visited yesterday as well. The last pandal, before the severe downpour, which abruptly halted all of our further plans. Took provisional shelter at the Ahiritola Ghat untill the rain subsided. 🙁","url":"https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111894883359485991"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:59:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111653404691071073"],"id":"2111653404691071073","in_reply_to_user_id":"60282284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":79,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111621420472246638","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@mrs__hazel On Saptami 2024, a heavy downpour happened for almost 40/45 mins, starting at around 7pm ... I , at that very moment, was at the Ahiritola Pujo which probably was one of the best that year... The police took barely 2 to 3 mins to clear our the entire queue ...","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111653404691071073"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:43:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111649366587154726"],"id":"2111649366587154726","in_reply_to_user_id":"2044335618512076800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111531598130889212","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@AarKiBolboBolo2 It rained last year too... There was a downpour on Ashtami during 2024 too... In 2024 , I was at the Ahiritola pujo when the downpour started and it took the administration just a couple of minutes to clear our the entire queue","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111649366587154726"},{"author_id":"803197771389861888","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111518921622999095"],"id":"2111518921622999095","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":4727,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"I’m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. ❤️\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab","url":"https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"},{"author_id":"70626051","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:43:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111437874298232933"],"id":"2111437874298232933","in_reply_to_user_id":"707265157659893761","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":56,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111334695694921759","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Abhijit_Basak83 Good work, great lighting. But crowd management poor. Santosh Mitra Square, Ahiritola stands out.","url":"https://x.com/wanderlust1587/status/2111437874298232933"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111427835042885632"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:03:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111427846212342175"],"id":"2111427846212342175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":5159,"like_count":683,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":25},"text":"#29 Visited Ahiritola Sarbojonin— an absolute stunner by Subrata Mridha. https://t.co/xTarrNUaD8","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111427846212342175"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111355515628552192","3_2111355534897262592","3_2111355550504255488","3_2111355563774984192"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-17T07:16:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111355574420230404"],"id":"2111355574420230404","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":413,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#73 Visited Naktala Udayan Sangha. They are back from their downfall after arrest of \"অপা\". One of the best theme of Kolkata this year. Their theme is \"কাল ধ্বনি\". They have illustrated the history, importance and impact of Panjikas. Beautifully executed. Absolutely recommend it. https://t.co/BIrqvmTgN1","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111355574420230404"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111130487549050880","3_2111130501486608384","3_2111130514396770304","3_2111130527109681152"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-16T16:21:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111130536941064655"],"id":"2111130536941064655","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":35,"impression_count":8635,"like_count":748,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":50},"text":"#24 Visited Nalin Sarkar Street— A Sanatan Dinda masterclass. He loves to play with colours &amp; he absolutely nails it here. https://t.co/iw8Y3Or6Hr","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111130536941064655"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111110882340360192","3_2111110898270314497","3_2111110913822711808","3_2111110931568799744"]},"author_id":"1950805189201657856","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:04:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111110948413177945"],"id":"2111110948413177945","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":181,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Behala Nutun sangha, Behala Friends club, MD Ali park, College Square.\nToday's pandal hopping.\nMe &amp; Bestie Saw many places as well but here my favorite one's. ✨✨ https://t.co/qoPrxs4S3D","url":"https://x.com/mooniepie_7_613/status/2111110948413177945"},{"author_id":"2074369902341918720","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:54:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111078359392502113"],"id":"2111078359392502113","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"North Kolkata’s Durga Puja Themes 2026: Which Pandals Stand Out?\n\nKashi Bose Lane: ‘আদিম’\nNabin Pally\nKumartuli\nAhiritola\nPandal-hopping plans\n\nDiscover what makes Durga Puja 2026 worth exploring. Watch the video for a closer look 👇\nhttps://t.co/6GobBLX8jy","url":"https://x.com/Mchatterjee099/status/2111078359392502113"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110977127692877825"]},"author_id":"819130177","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:12:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110977142549029164"],"id":"2110977142549029164","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":164,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"পুজো মানেই আনন্দ, পুজো মানেই মিলন। তাই উৎসবের আলো ছড়িয়ে পড়ুক সবার ঘরে—প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষমদের পাশে দাঁড়িয়ে পুজোকে সবার করে তোলার উদ্যোগ রাজ্যের নগরোন্নয়ন ও পুর বিষয়ক দপ্তরের। বুধবার দক্ষিণ কলকাতার সুরুচি সঙ্ঘের প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষম মানুষদের জন্য বিশেষ ‘রেস্টিং https://t.co/MfwVI7Pcpr","url":"https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2110977142549029164"},{"author_id":"2984417534","created_at":"2026-10-15T12:56:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110716323819082115"],"id":"2110716323819082115","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3893,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":10},"text":"LIVE : টালা বারোয়ারি সার্বজনীন শ্রীশ্রী দুর্গাপুজোর শুভ উদ্বোধন অনুষ্ঠানে উপস্থিত আছেন কেন্দ্রীয় মন্ত্রী @DrSukantaBJP  https://t.co/5Q4NykGfQ8","url":"https://x.com/BJP4Bengal/status/2110716323819082115"},{"author_id":"1895446981386162176","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:26:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110633432384741810"],"id":"2110633432384741810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"কলকাতার দুর্গাপুজোয় ‘মহা মিলন’ থিম, ঢাকুরিয়া শহিদনগরে উদ্বোধন রাজ্যপাল আর এন রবির\n#KolkataDurgaPuja #MahaMilan #RNRavi #DhakuriaSahidnagar #DurgaPuja2026 #SuruchiSangha #Ahiritola #WestBengal #newslivebangla\n https://t.co/gxfNagrea9","url":"https://x.com/Newslive_Bangla/status/2110633432384741810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110443772169592832","13_2110443772165414912"]},"author_id":"1312456956645343234","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:56:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110444664058982460"],"id":"2110444664058982460","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":4194,"like_count":97,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"Avik's Great Durga Pujo Pandal hopping night out log (1/n)\n\nAhiritola: Homage to sweets of Bengal - impressive idol design - pandal missing the final touches here and there but efficient use of limited space - 7/10. https://t.co/9AE6HOJBzd","url":"https://x.com/just_avik/status/2110444664058982460"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110248752569360384"]},"author_id":"62762183","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:58:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110248778200682765"],"id":"2110248778200682765","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2544,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the https://t.co/bzlRoblDJA","url":"https://x.com/Openthemag/status/2110248778200682765"},{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":4716,"like_count":108,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}],"includes":{"media":[{"height":3264,"media_key":"3_2112259896364429312","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBBLzwa8AADwpD.jpg","width":2448},{"height":3264,"media_key":"3_2112259915347832832","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVBBM6easAAggxh.jpg","width":2448},{"height":2448,"media_key":"3_2112210068544663552","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVAT3cqbsAAoW9Y.jpg","width":3264},{"height":3264,"media_key":"3